&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;住友電気工業㈱入社&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:10.5pt;min-height:10.5pt;"&gt;
